{"PLEAD","tmp=fresh",{"NO NO NO, PLEASE DON'T SHOOT, I DIDN'T MEAN TO!","I didn't do anything! I SWEAR I didn't do anything!","Please, please, I'll do whatever you say - anything","What did I do? Just tell me what I did!","Look at me, look at my face - I'm not a threat"},false,false,false,{[1]="firearm"}},
{"PLEAD","tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"No no- I'll do anything, just don't, please!"}},
{"PLEAD","tmp=seasoned",{"You don't have to do this, you really don't","Whatever you heard about me, it's not true - please","I'll leave the county, I'll leave the whole county"}},
{"PLEAD","tmp=fresh,seasoned",{"I've got food in the bag - take it - take all of it","I'll walk, I'll walk right now and never come back","I'm nobody - I'm NOBODY, I'm not worth a bullet","Don't shoot, there's more of them everywhere, they'll hear!","I surrendered, I already surrendered - please see that"},false,false,false,{[3]="firearm",[4]="firearm"}},
{"PLEAD","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh",{"There's a little girl waiting on me - please - please","Hands are up! Hands are UP! I'm not doing nothing!","Can of peaches in the side pocket - take it, I was saving it for nothing anyway","I dug two graves this week with a garden spade - don't make somebody dig mine","Whatever you want, whatever it is - say it slow so I hear it right"}},
{"PLEAD","role=rescue_clergy,family_woman|tmp=fresh",{"Please! I just taught Sunday school, I never hurt a soul!"}},
{"PLEAD","role=rescue_medical",{"I'm a nurse, I can help you - let me help you instead","I'm a paramedic, kill me and the next person who needs stitches dies too","I'm a nurse, eight years at the county, you'll want me alive eventually"}},
{"PLEAD","role=worker|tmp=fresh,seasoned|world=vehicle",{"I fix engines, that's all I do, I fix engines"}},
{"PLEAD","role=family_elder|sex=f",{"I'm seventy-one years old - let an old woman go home","I'm an old woman, what am I going to do to you? Let me be"}},
{"PLEAD","role=family_elder",{"{g:Son|Young lady}, I have grandchildren, I have grandchildren","{sir}, I'm eighty-one and I bruise - Point that at the ground, please"}},
{"PLEAD","role=family_youth",{"I'm fifteen - I'm FIFTEEN - please, {mister}","I'm only nineteen, I haven't done anything to anybody"}},
{"PLEAD","tmp=seasoned,veteran|world=road",{"One shot and every dead thing on this road comes - think!"},false,false,false,{[1]="firearm"}},
{"PLEAD","tmp=seasoned|mood=grim",{"Take my boots if you want them, just let me walk off"}},
{"PLEAD","tmp=seasoned|sex=m",{"{sir}, please - {Sir}, I'm asking you as a {g:man|woman}"}},
{"PLEAD","role=rescue_clergy|mood=grim",{"God is watching you right now, he is watching"}},
{"PLEAD","tmp=fresh|hour=20,4|mood=fear",{"Please, I just want to see morning - that's all - morning"}},
{"PLEAD","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh",{"Please, don't, I have two girls waiting at my sister's in Riverside - please","I'll turn around and walk away, okay? Please let me","Take the bag, take the whole bag, just point that somewhere else, please","I'm nobody, I sold carpet in Louisville - please, I'm nobody","I'm just trying to get by. Please let me go","I won't tell anybody about you - who would I even tell?","Please, I'm a nurse, I can be useful to you - just don't","I'm begging - look at me, I'm on my knees here","I have to get out of here. Please let me leave","My hands are up- see? Nobody's gotta get hurt, right?!","There's a case of canned peaches in my car - it's yours, just let me walk","Please, whoever you are, I just want to get home to {town}","We're not sick, none of us - look at my arms - please, just look","I've got sixty dollars, I know it's worth nothing now - it's all I have","I don't even know how to fire a gun, I'm no threat to you","I'm diabetic and I can barely walk, I'm just trying to reach the church","I just want to make it through today. Please let me","Please, God, please, I'll do whatever you want, just put it down","I'm not with anybody, I'm not with anybody! I'm just trying to live","I watched those things take the whole Miller family - please don't let a person be what gets me","I taught second grade at the elementary school, I'm not dangerous, I promise","I got bit yesterday, I've got maybe a day - let me spend it at home, okay?","My dog's tied up at home, nobody else is going to untie him - please","I'll forget your face, I'm already forgetting it","It's just me and my grandpa left, he can't walk - I have to get back to him","Please don't leave me dead out here","Please, I'm only trying to get by. I don't want any trouble!","Please, my mom's in Rosewood and she doesn't know I'm alive","Whatever I did, I'm sorry, I don't even know what it was, but I'm sorry","There's a dozen of them behind me! I'm just running, please let me through!","My little girl still sleeps with the light on - please, somebody has to turn it on","It's for my girl over at the Kelso place, please, it's all I got!","They got my wife Tuesday, my boy Thursday - please, let me walk, if that's alright","You can have all of it - could I keep the picture? It's the only one","Don't let it be a person, I came this far - don't let it be a person","Please. I need to keep going. That's all I'm asking","I'll walk backwards - see? Backwards, nobody has to do anything","I'll count to a thousand - out loud - just let me go, okay?","You were somebody's kid once, I'm somebody's kid, that's all I got","There's a dog tied at my place, nobody else knows he's there - please","I'm not brave, I want you to know I'm not gonna be brave about this","Please. I can't give you anything worth my life"},false,false,false,{[15]="firearm"}},
{"PLEAD","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|sex=m|day=0,20",{"They got my wife on Friday, there's nothing left on me worth taking - just let me pass, if that's alright"}},
{"PLEAD","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|sex=f",{"Please don't do this. I can't fight you","My husband's a deputy - he'll... no, no, he won't - please just let me go","Please, I'm pregnant - please"}},
{"PLEAD","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|hour=4,11",{"I buried my brother this morning with a garden shovel - I can't do any more today, okay?"},false,false,false,{[1]="blunt"}},
