{"PLEAD","reg=family",{"Please! You don't have to shoot!","Don't cut me! I've got a little girl at home!","Please don't hurt me! I just want to leave!","Please don't punch me, my family needs me","Take whatever you want. Just leave me alive"},false,false,false,{[1]="firearm",[2]="blade",[4]="fists"}},
