{"REGROUP","",{"Let's get back together!","Stay where we can find each other!","Come together, carefully!","Don't lose the others!","We need each other right now!","Find your way back to us!","Everybody, stay within reach!","Let's not get scattered again!","Get together before we do anything else!","Stay close enough to hear!","Let's sort ourselves out first!","Don't go off alone now!","Come on. Back with the others!","Keep us together. Please","Regroup, regroup, everybody over here","Come on, bunch up, everybody in","Come in, let me count heads","Back together, back together, count off","Over here, over here, c'mon","Gather round, gather round, quick","Everybody here? Where's Dale? Oh, there he is","Tighten up, tighten up","Fall in, nice and close","Let's get our heads straight, then move","Check your gear, then the guy next to you","Wait, who's not here?","Where did everyone go, I turned around and you were all gone"}},
