{"SEASON_SPRING","",{"Redbuds are out, they don't know anything happened","Mud season, boots never dry","Dogwoods bloom around Easter, if anyone's counting","Spring peepers at night, frogs don't care about any of this","Planting weather, if there was anybody to plant for","First warm day and everyone's outside, same as ever","Pollen's thick, my eyes are running again","Warm enough to sleep outside, first time in months","Warm days, cold nights, wear layers, spring tricks you","Spring, green again, flowers pushing up","Birds, so many birds, loud ones","A good time of year, mostly","Warm days, cool nights, nice"}},
